{"step_index":395,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-18T01:27:46Z","thinking":"Considering the color data provided, need to determine what color corresponds to \"theme 5\" in the standard Excel palette. Examining the Office theme color definitions, \"theme 5\" is identified as \"Accent 2\", which corresponds to Orange. Thus, I'll map theme 5 to Orange.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Inspect theme1.xml to get exact RGB of theme colors","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst unzipper = require('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/add_kyobo_popup_store/node_modules/unzipper');\n\nasync function main() {\n  const filePath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/오늘/(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명.xlsx';\n  const directory = await unzipper.Open.file(filePath);\n  const themeFile = directory.files.find(d => d.path === 'xl/theme/theme1.xml');\n  if (themeFile) {\n    const content = (await themeFile.buffer()).toString('utf8');\n    console.log('Theme content:');\n    const colorSchemeRegex = /<a:clrScheme[^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/a:clrScheme>/;\n    const m = content.match(colorSchemeRegex);\n    if (m) {\n      console.log(m[1].replace(/></g, '>\\n<'));\n    }\n  } else {\n    console.log('theme1.xml not found');\n  }\n}\n\nmain().catch(console.error);\n","Description":"Inspect theme colors script","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6740dd59-eb21-4d68-9720-ce1a0bd30a53\\scratch\\get_theme.js","toolAction":"Writing get_theme.js","toolSummary":"Write get theme script"}}]}
