{"step_index":411,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-18T01:28:36Z","thinking":"Analyzing sales data, I see instances of \"undefined\" values for either the 24매출 or 25매출 columns across different rows. Specifically observing rows 1806, 1757, and 1763 for this undefined data pattern. The goal now is to understand the implications of this missing data.\n\n\nThe prompt's \"파란거칠한거 매출액만 찾아바라 정확하게\" is ambiguous: It could request either searching for sales revenue of blue-highlighted items or identifying existing revenue in blue-highlighted rows. Examining the Excel file, the goal is now to determine how many rows have blue highlighting and then determine if sales data is present for each of those highlighted rows. A script will check the file for the presence of blue highlighting to filter and refine the user's request.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Detailed breakdown of all blue highlighted rows","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const path = require('path');\nconst workspaceRoot = 'C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/add_kyobo_popup_store';\nconst ExcelJS = require(path.join(workspaceRoot, 'node_modules/exceljs'));\n\nasync function main() {\n  const filePath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/오늘/(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명.xlsx';\n  const wb = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  await wb.xlsx.readFile(filePath);\n  const ws = wb.getWorksheet('기업체 리스트');\n\n  const blueRows = [];\n\n  ws.eachRow((row, rowNumber) => {\n    if (rowNumber === 1) return;\n\n    let hasBlue = false;\n    let blueCols = [];\n\n    row.eachCell({ includeEmpty: true }, (cell, colNumber) => {\n      const fill = cell.fill;\n      if (fill && fill.fgColor) {\n        const fg = fill.fgColor;\n        if (fg.theme === 8 || fg.theme === 4 || (fg.argb && (fg.argb.includes('DDEBF7') || fg.argb.includes('BDD7EE')))) {\n          hasBlue = true;\n          blueCols.push(colNumber);\n        }\n      }\n    });\n\n    if (hasBlue) {\n      const vals = Array.isArray(row.values) ? row.values.slice(1) : [];\n      blueRows.push({\n        rowNumber,\n        blueCols,\n        sn: vals[1],\n        name: vals[2],\n        bizno: vals[3],\n        rep: vals[6],\n        phone: vals[7],\n        category: vals[11],\n        status: vals[12],\n        rev24: vals[16],\n        rev25: vals[17]\n      });\n    }\n  });\n\n  console.log(`Total blue rows: ${blueRows.length}`);\n  const withRev = blueRows.filter(r => r.rev24 !== undefined || r.rev25 !== undefined);\n  const withoutRev = blueRows.filter(r => r.rev24 === undefined && r.rev25 === undefined);\n\n  console.log(`With revenue already in sheet: ${withRev.length}`);\n  console.log(`Without revenue in sheet: ${withoutRev.length}`);\n\n  console.log('\\n=== Already has revenue in sheet ===');\n  withRev.forEach(r => {\n    console.log(`[Row ${r.rowNumber}] 순번: ${r.sn} | 업체명: ${r.name} | 사업자번호: ${r.bizno} | 대표: ${r.rep} | 24년: ${r.rev24} | 25년: ${r.rev25}`);\n  });\n\n  console.log('\\n=== All blue rows listing ===');\n  blueRows.forEach((r, idx) => {\n    console.log(`${idx + 1}. [Row ${r.rowNumber}] 순번: ${r.sn} | ${r.name} | 사업자: ${r.bizno} | 대표: ${r.rep} | 24년: ${r.rev24 || '-'} | 25년: ${r.rev25 || '-'}`);\n  });\n}\n\nmain().catch(console.error);\n","Description":"Breakdown of blue rows and revenue","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6740dd59-eb21-4d68-9720-ce1a0bd30a53\\scratch\\breakdown_blue.js","toolAction":"Writing breakdown script","toolSummary":"Write breakdown script"}}]}
